infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title The ~100 ms budget, spent down to the server's slice
  desc Each stage eats part of the budget; only what is left can serve
  sequences
    - label End-to-end budget ~100 ms
      desc Suggestions must beat the next keystroke
    - label Client debounce: tens of ms
      desc Wait for a typing pause before firing
    - label Network round trip: a big chunk
      desc Client to edge or origin and back
    - label Server: only tens of ms
      desc Where the precomputed trie lookup must fit
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
